  "classNote": "Selected existing registration/login members. OTP is an in-process Map, not a database model. JwtService here is @nestjs/jwt. Login has no second-factor OTP challenge; Verify2FaDto is unused. Role-specific profile/Store/Wallet writes are separate.",
  "subtitle": "Current web flow: CUSTOMER registration with email OTP → automatic password login → JWT. Login OTP 2FA is not implemented.",
